      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NEO DEVERE (1) has a strong overall record having 13 wins and 27 places from 60 starts including a last start third (30.35) over 525m at The Meadows. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Has the inside draw and looks tough to beat. MISTER RICO (3) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from four tries. Missed the frame latest (25.17) when seventh over 435m at Sale in a Grade 4/5. Looks a key chance on best figures. ASTON LORENZ (4) goes very well at the distance with two wins and a placing from five starts. Below best last time at this track (30.24) in a Grade 5, finishing a 9 length fifth. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. STREAM IT (6) was in the money last start and likely to feature again.",
